+## Visual language
+
+| Role | Token | Value |
+| ---- | ----- | ----- |
+| Primary flight / nav data | tactical cyan | `#00F0FF` |
+| Secondary telemetry | amber | `#FFB000` |
+| Caution | hazard orange | `#FF6600` |
+| Emergency | red | `#FF2244` |
+| Confirmation | green | `#3EE88B` |
